{"title":"Orc Guard","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Orc Guard is a guard — a named <a href=\"#/monster/orc\">Orc</a> seen at level 16.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Orc Guard</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Rustpick Mine (place 2)</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 6×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-1000043840\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"orc-guard\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-legs\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/08ecaf2ee25350d177fd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iron-warmace\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iron Warmace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Orcs</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/orc-triumph\">Orc Triumph</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/orc-wizard\">Orc Wizard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/orc-champion\">Orc Champion</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/varruk-the-raider\">Varruk the Raider</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/the-yokemaster\">The Yokemaster</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/orc-jailer\">Orc Jailer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/gorrat-the-forgemaster\">Gorrat the Forgemaster</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/437e64fc8b90222ab1bd.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Orc Guard</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/orc\">Orc</a></td></tr><tr><th>Role</th><td>guard</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>16</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>50</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>15 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}